# AI Insights feature — environment.
# This feature introduces NO new environment variables. The AI provider endpoint,
# model, and API key are configured in the panel (Settings → AI Assistant) and the
# key is stored encrypted in the database — never via env.
#
# The only env var the feature relies on already exists project-wide:

# Required to encrypt the AI provider API key at rest (AES-256-GCM). The same key
# also protects Telegram/SMTP secrets. If unset, secrets fall back to plaintext and
# saving the AI key is refused.
ULTRON_SECRET_KEY=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
